---
import LegalPage from '../layouts/LegalPage.astro';
import GoodFaithNotice from '../components/GoodFaithNotice.astro';
import ToConfirm from '../components/ToConfirm.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
import { url } from '../lib/url';
---

<LegalPage
  title="Good Faith Estimate"
  description="Your right to receive a Good Faith Estimate of the expected cost of care under the No Surprises Act, and how The Elephant Path provides one."
>
  <p>
    Because The Elephant Path is a private pay practice and does not bill insurance, you have the right
    to know what your care is expected to cost before it begins. The following notice is required by
    the federal No Surprises Act.
  </p>

  <h2>Your right to a Good Faith Estimate</h2>
  <GoodFaithNotice />

  <h2>How I provide your Good Faith Estimate</h2>
  <p>
    After your free consultation, and before your first session, I’ll give you a written Good Faith
    Estimate based on the session length and how often we plan to meet. You can also ask for one at
    any time. <ToConfirm note="TO CONFIRM: how and when the estimate is delivered" />
  </p>
  <p>
    My current fees are listed on the <a href={url('/services/#fees')}>Services &amp; Fees</a> page. If
    you have questions, please call <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phoneDisplay}</a>.
  </p>
</LegalPage>
